API Server: The entry point for Kubernetes API requests, including requests from kubectl.
etcd: Stores Kubernetes cluster state and configuration.
Scheduler: Selects a suitable worker node for each unscheduled Pod.
kubelet: Runs on worker nodes and works with the container runtime to ensure assigned Pods run as specified.
